{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id879110045"}, "name":{"label":"AusomeBeanz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-20T19:42:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14574667121"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t live without"}, "content":{"label":"This has been a lifesaver for me with juggling school, appointments and work schedules for 8 people - and all the grocery requests and need to dos! The color coordination for people is great too so I can easily pay extra attention to certain appointments for the kiddos rather than having to check who the appointment is for by clicking the event. Easy to navigate and like that can be used on the web too. \n\nOne feature I wish it would have in the calendar is the ability to attach a photo to the notes, for example, a flyer from social media that has extra details of an event so all can see it and to save writing so much extra info. Or even a screen shot of digital tickets so we’re not scrambling trying to remember which email it was in or finding it among hundreds of photos lol. We could just open the event in the calendar and voila! There’s our QR code or whatever. That would be HUGE!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id153343985"}, "name":{"label":"ScottsaGator"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-20T16:40:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14574210708"}, "title":{"label":"One simple upgrade it needs"}, "content":{"label":"My wife and I use this app for family schedules and are generally pleased with it. One thing it needs: the ability to note events other than birthdays (like anniversaries maybe?). \nA simple copy of the birthdays code would do it. No need for consumer research. You’re welcome!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
