{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id136005528"}, "name":{"label":"ghytfdety"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-14T07:28:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14549127257"}, "title":{"label":"Appointments Are Dropping off"}, "content":{"label":"After noticing appointments are not staying on the app, I asked the Cozi support if there was a way to determine if someone is deleting the appointments or if they are falling off. I was told there isn’t a way to track that information. I have had way too many fall off of the calendar this year. Even though I confirm them with staff after entering them into the calendar. I am choosing not to renew my gold account at this point. No issues until 2026.\n\nCozi’s response:\nCozi responded to your review of Cozi Family Organizer\t\t\nCozi Family Organizer\nCozi\n\"Hi, We're sorry for any issues or concerns! Cozi doesn't offer a calendar tracking feature that would enable you to identify who in your account made changes to the calendar or when, and we've reiterated your request that we add this feature in the future. For now, though, any events that you add to the calendar with an online connection will remain in the calendar unless you or someone else in the account manually deletes them. There's no known reason for events that have been saved with an online connection to be deleted other than if someone in the account deletes them. We apologize again for any issues you're having, and if we can help further with this or with anything else please reach us again at cozi.com/contact-us so we can try to help further. Thanks, Cozi\"\n\nI confirm my appointments are saved in the app before I leave the office. It has nothing to do with an online connection as these appointments show in the app before I leave the offices (with a wifi connection) and if they are in the app and saved they shouldn’t be randomly falling off the calendar, no issues until it just recently started happening this year. I would have missed my appointments had it not been for a text message from the provider’s office.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
