{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id281679663"}, "name":{"label":"llburgess"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-11T10:56:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14537935285"}, "title":{"label":"Too many changes"}, "content":{"label":"It seems like all the update are pushing more AI into this app and every time I figure it out it changes again.  Also it doesn't link with alot of other apps like Alexa for my calendar reminders. I've been using Cozi for a decade but not sure I'll renew next year.  If I have to input everything twice I might as well just use Google Calendar ever if I don't like it nearly as much.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id176185416"}, "name":{"label":"VCJohnson"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-10T05:49:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14532998911"}, "title":{"label":"A must for us!"}, "content":{"label":"Cozi is the only way I keep track of our busy life- from kids' multiple sports practices and games, school and church events to all of our appointments, family events, birthdays, parties, etc. Cozi keeps us all on the same page. I love that we can use it from our phones and also on our Skylight calendar..that way my kids can view the calendar too!  It automatically syncs and updates which is so easy and amazing! It's the best!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id689555543"}, "name":{"label":"krista0606"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-08T06:05:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14525205434"}, "title":{"label":"MUST HAVE"}, "content":{"label":"Greatest organizing app, truly!!\n\nOur entire family uses Cozi, and I honestly don’t know how we would keep everyone’s schedules straight without it. Everyone can have access, add their own events and appointments, and see what the rest of the family has going on. With a busy family and everyone going in different directions, this app is GOLD to us. I LIVE off of it!\n\nMy only wish for the developers would be to add the option to upload a photo directly to an appointment or event. Sometimes you have a birthday invitation, doctor’s appointment information, school flyer, etc., and it would be so much easier to just attach a picture instead of typing out all the details.\n\nOther than that, I truly cannot recommend Cozi enough. If you’re trying to keep an entire family organized and on the same page, this app is a lifesaver!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
